WEBVTT

00:22.920 --> 00:25.440
<i>I'm here for you.</i>
<i>Ai Amano.</i>

00:33.930 --> 00:38.760
Thank you!
Thank you for choosing my video.

00:39.730 --> 00:42.760
My name's Ai Amano,
and I'm sixteen.

00:42.840 --> 00:44.640
What's your name?

00:46.310 --> 00:49.070
Why do you look so sad?

00:51.810 --> 00:55.720
I see.
Unrequited love.

00:55.780 --> 00:58.380
Don't let it get you down.

00:58.450 --> 01:00.720
She just doesn't understand.

01:00.790 --> 01:04.280
You've got a lot to offer.

01:04.990 --> 01:07.360
I know I'm not much, but...

01:07.430 --> 01:11.830
I'll do my best
to cheer you up.

01:16.200 --> 01:19.970
I see.
It's that bad.

01:20.840 --> 01:25.610
You really need me,
right from the heart.

01:28.620 --> 01:31.950
That's it! I'll stay with you
for as long as it takes.

01:38.230 --> 01:40.590
W-W-What the hell?

01:53.510 --> 01:56.310
I-It's so warm.

02:21.740 --> 02:23.300
W-What the--?

02:39.650 --> 02:43.280
S-Some girl just came
outta my screen!

05:03.530 --> 05:05.590
T-There she is.

05:15.340 --> 05:17.180
She's real!
She's really here!

05:17.250 --> 05:19.510
T-That's some video!

05:19.580 --> 05:22.140
Modern technology's
really something.

05:22.220 --> 05:24.310
Einstein, you're a genius!

05:24.390 --> 05:26.250
Stephen Hawking, I love you!

05:26.320 --> 05:29.090
God hasn't forsaken me!

05:29.160 --> 05:32.530
He's looking out for
Yota "Dateless" Moteuchi!

05:32.590 --> 05:36.120
This must be a love goddess...

05:36.200 --> 05:39.220
that God sent down from heaven.

05:40.200 --> 05:42.140
A face cuter than Riho!

05:42.200 --> 05:44.870
A body finer than Rie the beauty queen!

05:44.940 --> 05:47.740
A personality nicer than Noriko's!

05:47.810 --> 05:51.510
The face is just my type!
The style is just my type!

05:51.580 --> 05:54.050
And hooters from heaven!

05:55.520 --> 05:59.080
But how did a girl get
out of a VCR and into my room?

06:00.390 --> 06:03.190
My VCR's been a little flaky
since morning, but--

06:03.260 --> 06:05.520
It couldn't be--

06:06.690 --> 06:08.690
But--

06:14.200 --> 06:18.040
What happened?
I think her bust just shrunk.

06:33.760 --> 06:36.820
Stupid jerk! Playing me
on a broken VCR!

06:36.890 --> 06:38.760
I thought I was gonna die!

06:39.860 --> 06:42.460
Wait.
That didn't sound like me.

06:42.530 --> 06:43.360
Who cares?

06:44.370 --> 06:46.300
N-No way.

06:46.370 --> 06:50.240
Something's wrong.
She's not supposed to be like this!

06:50.300 --> 06:52.300
Glad you like me.

06:52.970 --> 06:56.710
My name is Ai Amano,
video girl at large.

06:56.780 --> 06:58.710
"Video girl"?

07:01.720 --> 07:03.880
"Motenai" as in "dateless"?

07:03.950 --> 07:06.180
That's "Yota Moteuchi"!

07:06.950 --> 07:10.360
Then, Yota.
What do we do now?

07:11.430 --> 07:15.730
We video girls are just
made for men.

07:15.800 --> 07:18.630
We can do anything you'd like.

07:22.770 --> 07:23.790
Where is it?

07:23.870 --> 07:26.670
Where? Where? Where?

07:26.740 --> 07:30.870
Here it is: "So You've Got
Her Alone--What Comes Next?"

07:30.950 --> 07:34.310
Okay. I can do that.

07:38.850 --> 07:41.950
Let's start with foreplay
before going hardcore.

07:45.060 --> 07:47.760
H-H-Hardcore! As in--

07:48.130 --> 07:50.190
"How To Get Ready
For The First Time"--

07:50.260 --> 07:51.230
Okay. Okay.

07:52.400 --> 07:53.130
Clip nails.

07:55.840 --> 07:59.000
Deodorize. Brush Teeth.

07:59.070 --> 08:00.560
Get in shape!

08:02.080 --> 08:06.380
This really means a lot to me.

08:06.450 --> 08:08.310
Please be gentle.

08:10.820 --> 08:13.980
I was kidding.
Learn the difference.

08:15.020 --> 08:17.550
Now I'll show you
my specialty.

08:17.630 --> 08:21.860
<i>What am I thinking?</i>
<i>Moemi's my one and only.</i>

08:29.340 --> 08:34.440
<i>If I'd been thinking,</i>
<i>Moemi would never have been hurt.</i>

08:35.940 --> 08:38.910
<i>Poor Moemi!</i>

08:40.210 --> 08:42.510
<i>Poor Moemi!</i>

08:46.050 --> 08:49.050
<i>A video store?</i>
<i>Here?</i>

08:49.820 --> 08:51.220
H-Hold it!
Wait!

08:53.860 --> 08:57.200
Okay. What are you?
Tell me the truth.

08:57.270 --> 08:59.460
I told you.
I'm a video girl.

09:01.440 --> 09:03.770
Does she appeal to you?

09:04.270 --> 09:08.940
It's nice to have a customer.
You're our third one.

09:09.680 --> 09:14.810
Only the pure of heart
can see this store.

09:15.820 --> 09:17.340
For example...

09:17.420 --> 09:21.650
a young man who sheds
tears for another person's pain...

09:21.720 --> 09:24.620
when his own heart
is breaking as well.

09:24.690 --> 09:27.290
H-How'd you know?

09:27.360 --> 09:30.420
<i>I came outta the video</i>
<i>to brighten up your broken heart.</i>

09:30.670 --> 09:32.760
Didn't you hear the video?

09:32.830 --> 09:35.630
That's not what I mean!

09:35.700 --> 09:38.430
Give it a break!
Quit sweatin' the details.

09:38.510 --> 09:40.530
It's no wonder
that "Dateless" got rejected!

09:43.240 --> 09:44.910
<i>I'm in love with Niimai.</i>

09:50.380 --> 09:54.380
So what if I was rejected?
So what if I'm dateless?

09:54.460 --> 09:57.860
If you're just here
to lecture me...

09:57.930 --> 10:02.520
forget it!
Pack up and get out!

10:11.870 --> 10:12.970
What's wrong?

10:13.040 --> 10:16.440
It's all your fault!
You played me on your broken VCR!

10:16.510 --> 10:19.280
I thought I just talked
like a guy!

10:19.350 --> 10:22.750
Now I got a WIENER!
What'cha gonna do about it?

10:22.820 --> 10:24.620
You're kidding!

10:25.720 --> 10:27.850
It's true. Feel.

10:27.920 --> 10:29.620
Nothing's there.

10:31.160 --> 10:33.630
- I lied.
- You really had me going.

10:39.430 --> 10:41.160
Lecher.

10:46.770 --> 10:49.300
<i>Don't "tee-hee"me.</i>

10:49.380 --> 10:51.010
But she's so cute!

10:53.380 --> 10:59.980
<i>So, who is she?</i>
<i>Who is this girl you like?</i>

11:00.150 --> 11:04.960
O-Okay, if I tell you mine,
will you tell me yours?

11:07.630 --> 11:10.960
No. Mine's hopeless.

11:14.070 --> 11:18.230
The guy I like is too popular.

11:24.480 --> 11:25.950
Just try it!

11:26.010 --> 11:28.810
You'll always want Ai
by your side!

11:31.520 --> 11:34.750
H-H-Home cooking!

11:34.820 --> 11:39.190
I've been motherless for ten years.
Dad's always overseas on trips.

11:39.260 --> 11:41.590
I never get to eat
home cooking!

11:41.660 --> 11:43.490
Digging in!

11:44.630 --> 11:46.400
It's good, huh?

11:54.910 --> 11:57.400
Pigs wouldn't eat this slop!

11:57.480 --> 11:58.810
You're awful!

11:58.880 --> 12:01.350
My profile says that pro chefs
wish they could cook like me.

12:03.420 --> 12:06.350
See? It's pretty good--

12:11.190 --> 12:14.390
That's not possible.
I'll make it again.

12:18.770 --> 12:20.000
Don't bother.

12:22.170 --> 12:25.700
After you went to all the trouble--

12:30.750 --> 12:32.940
Saving grace number one.

12:42.920 --> 12:45.020
He's so popular...

12:45.090 --> 12:49.150
and I can't compete,
so I may as well give up.

12:49.230 --> 12:50.250
<i>It's Takashi!</i>

12:54.570 --> 12:55.870
<i>She's talking about Takashi!</i>

12:55.940 --> 13:00.100
I'll bet he doesn't even know
I'm alive.

13:02.910 --> 13:06.010
You know who I mean, right?

13:06.780 --> 13:10.180
Moteuchi, now it's your turn.

13:17.290 --> 13:21.090
Don't give up!
You don't know how he feels!

13:24.770 --> 13:29.330
<i>W-What am I doing?</i>
<i>What's wrong with me?</i>

13:32.610 --> 13:36.340
"Saving grace number one"?

13:36.410 --> 13:38.440
What's the creepy grin for?

13:38.510 --> 13:41.450
Are you bein' a lecher again?

13:41.520 --> 13:42.780
You pervert!

13:42.850 --> 13:44.980
Quit that!
I am not!

13:45.050 --> 13:47.990
Don't hold back
on my account, Yota!

13:48.060 --> 13:48.780
Hey!

13:55.930 --> 13:58.160
Fast-forward?

13:58.300 --> 14:00.060
Rewind!

14:02.300 --> 14:03.170
Frame-by-frame!

14:03.740 --> 14:07.140
Cut-it-out-you-stu-pid-jerk!

14:07.210 --> 14:08.340
Slow!

14:08.410 --> 14:13.710
Quit...messing...with...
my...tape...you...moron!

14:16.220 --> 14:17.210
And now for stop--

14:21.890 --> 14:25.330
Listen, stupid! You hit "stop"
and I disappear!

14:26.230 --> 14:27.890
Y-You do?

14:33.430 --> 14:36.930
W-What're you doing!?
I can't use my VCR now!

14:37.000 --> 14:39.910
- Right.
- Right? But you--

14:40.170 --> 14:42.640
Touch it and you're dead!

14:42.710 --> 14:45.810
I only have one month
of playback! That's it!

14:45.880 --> 14:48.610
Press fast-forward
and you shorten my time!

14:48.680 --> 14:51.710
Don't turn off the power
or I'm gone for good!

14:51.790 --> 14:52.780
Yes'm.

14:54.660 --> 14:56.520
So much for movies.

14:58.560 --> 15:00.620
But you've got me instead.

15:01.530 --> 15:05.330
<i>All right. I won't get bored</i>
<i>with her around.</i>

15:05.400 --> 15:07.370
<i>She'll be gone</i>
<i>in a month anyway.</i>

15:07.430 --> 15:12.000
The beauty, Ai, has come to stay
in the Beast's mansion.

15:12.070 --> 15:15.770
And what fate awaits
our little Ai?

15:17.380 --> 15:19.810
Three's a crowd, huh?

15:19.950 --> 15:22.610
Two together and romance in the air.

15:22.680 --> 15:24.210
Here's two lovers sodas.

15:25.990 --> 15:27.450
Thanks, Niimai.

15:28.520 --> 15:30.960
<i>Takashi, don't!</i>
<i>The plan's all screwed up!</i>

15:31.030 --> 15:35.860
I'll bet the girl Yota likes
turns out to be Moemi.

15:50.410 --> 15:55.180
He's just joking.
Don't go playing with Moemi's mind.

15:55.880 --> 15:57.850
Yota.

15:57.920 --> 16:00.220
This drink isn't
what I expected.

16:01.160 --> 16:06.180
Oh, yeah!Just a joke.
Just leading you on.

16:06.290 --> 16:08.760
That's what you always do.

16:08.830 --> 16:10.990
Tell me the truth, Moteuchi!

16:13.230 --> 16:17.690
I told you that I was
in love with Niimai, didn't I?

16:39.760 --> 16:41.490
W-Whaddya mean,
"take a bath"?

16:41.560 --> 16:43.720
So I can wash your back!

16:43.800 --> 16:46.530
But my magazines
never covered this!

16:50.600 --> 16:53.570
What's your problem?
I'm not taking a bath in my clothes.

16:53.640 --> 16:55.010
B-But--

16:58.680 --> 17:03.780
S-She's really taking 'em off!
I can't believe it.

17:11.560 --> 17:13.320
Who would call NOW!?

17:14.830 --> 17:16.130
Yeah, what?

17:16.200 --> 17:19.030
<i>Yota? It's me. Yota?</i>

17:19.100 --> 17:20.930
Takashi?

17:21.000 --> 17:23.770
<i>About the thing in the park today--</i>

17:23.840 --> 17:26.140
I'm in the bath, waiting!

17:26.210 --> 17:28.180
<i>Was that a girl's voice</i>
<i>I heard?</i>

17:29.440 --> 17:31.880
Yota, we gotta take
a bath together.

17:31.950 --> 17:33.940
- Cut it out!
<i>- Cut what out?</i>

17:34.010 --> 17:37.140
No, I wasn't talking to you.

17:37.220 --> 17:38.120
Let's go!

17:38.890 --> 17:41.550
Wha--Wha--
W-Whaddya think you're doing?

17:41.620 --> 17:43.060
<i>But I didn't do anything.</i>

17:43.120 --> 17:45.460
I-I said I don't mean you!

17:45.530 --> 17:47.650
Let's get the bath going,
Yota.

17:48.400 --> 17:50.190
There IS a girl there!

17:50.260 --> 17:52.670
Yota, are you shacking up?

17:52.730 --> 17:54.760
It's Moemi!
Good for you!

17:54.840 --> 17:58.470
"Shacking up"?
What are you talking about?

17:58.540 --> 18:02.100
I got this video.
The sound's from this video.

18:02.180 --> 18:03.580
A video girl.

18:03.640 --> 18:04.580
<i>Video!?</i>

18:04.650 --> 18:08.210
That's right.
I'm kinda busy. Bye.

18:11.550 --> 18:14.080
Bath time.

18:14.150 --> 18:15.590
Okay, fine--

18:24.300 --> 18:27.170
Guess he wasn't ready
for the Full Monty.

18:28.170 --> 18:32.330
<i>I told you that I was in love</i>
<i>with Niimai, didn't I?</i>

18:41.520 --> 18:44.450
<i>M-Moemi said it.</i>

18:51.230 --> 18:54.130
Sorry. You're not my type.

18:55.230 --> 18:57.890
T-Takashi, you didn't--

19:01.140 --> 19:03.260
M-Moemi!

19:05.610 --> 19:08.870
Too bad. I'll just have to find
somebody else.

19:08.980 --> 19:12.110
I'll introduce you
to some of my friends.

19:12.180 --> 19:13.610
Please do.

19:13.680 --> 19:15.240
M-Moemi!

19:25.290 --> 19:28.630
Can't call that
a rejection, though.

19:28.700 --> 19:31.600
She said she's in love
with Takashi.

19:33.900 --> 19:37.600
She didn't dump you
or say she hates you.

19:37.670 --> 19:40.040
- So you still have a chance.
- Think so?

19:40.110 --> 19:42.340
Okay! Here's the deal!

19:42.410 --> 19:47.400
Our objective: to make Yota
into a hunk that Moemi can't resist.

19:48.450 --> 19:51.010
That gives my life
a purpose, right?

19:51.080 --> 19:52.280
I still don't know.

19:52.350 --> 19:54.720
Leave everything to me!

19:54.990 --> 19:56.290
Geez, you're weird.

19:56.360 --> 19:58.620
That's that.
Now I'm gonna wash your back.

19:58.690 --> 19:59.960
N-No, I--

20:01.360 --> 20:05.460
It's my job as a video girl
to cheer you up.

20:05.530 --> 20:06.560
I'll pass.

20:06.630 --> 20:07.690
Don't be shy!

20:09.140 --> 20:11.370
I said I'm gonna cheer you up!

20:11.440 --> 20:13.770
Any complaints?

20:17.950 --> 20:21.010
<i>I can feel her soft butt!</i>

20:21.080 --> 20:22.480
<i>It's kinda nice.</i>

20:22.550 --> 20:24.350
<i>And kinda pathetic.</i>

20:24.480 --> 20:26.350
You must be so happy!

20:26.420 --> 20:28.820
- Go a little lighter!
- You mean like this?

20:30.660 --> 20:32.250
W-Watch where you're grabbing!

20:32.330 --> 20:34.190
You gotta be clean all over!

20:34.260 --> 20:37.460
Just not there!

20:43.400 --> 20:48.030
I'm beat.
What a roller-coaster.

20:48.110 --> 20:52.840
Gotta say, when she does something,
she goes all out.

20:52.910 --> 20:54.070
Give her credit.

20:57.950 --> 20:59.920
Hey, your bed's in the guest room.

20:59.990 --> 21:01.220
Nighty-nite.

21:29.980 --> 21:33.780
<i>I told you that I was in love</i>
<i>with Niimai, didn't I?</i>

21:51.140 --> 21:53.970
<i>Sorry, you're not my type.</i>

22:32.280 --> 22:36.720
<i>I told you that I was</i>
<i>in love with Niimai, didn't I?</i>

22:37.920 --> 22:42.220
<i>My--</i>
<i>My heart broke today.</i>

22:52.330 --> 22:54.130
Moemi!

23:31.240 --> 23:34.270
It's okay, Yota.

23:34.340 --> 23:35.830
It's okay.

23:40.710 --> 23:42.380
Can't give up.

23:58.930 --> 24:03.930
<i>A t that point, my feelings</i>
<i>underwent a change.</i>

24:04.000 --> 24:07.170
<i>I realized that my time</i>
<i>with Ai was limited...</i>

24:07.240 --> 24:09.680
<i>and it made me sad.</i>

26:37.020 --> 26:38.750
My god, everybody!

26:38.860 --> 26:42.520
Yota brought a girl to school!

26:43.830 --> 26:45.890
Why did you come to school!?

26:46.130 --> 26:49.300
I'd promised I'd always
be with you.

26:50.000 --> 26:51.700
And so I thought...

26:51.970 --> 26:55.770
I'd go out
and give it my best try.

26:58.480 --> 27:01.380
I can count on your help, right?

27:03.520 --> 27:06.850
W-We're kissing distance.

27:07.850 --> 27:10.290
Yota, what're you up to?

27:10.520 --> 27:12.320
I--

27:13.060 --> 27:16.150
Maybe I should have fallen
for Moteuchi, instead.

27:18.400 --> 27:22.230
Video girls aren't able
to fall in love.

27:26.770 --> 27:28.400
<i>But--</i>
